config INFINIBAND_EHCA
	tristate "eHCA support"
	depends on IBMEBUS
	---help---
	This driver supports the deprecated IBM pSeries eHCA InfiniBand
	adapter.

	To compile the driver as a module, choose M here. The module
	will be called ib_ehca.

